OL,3,GNEWSAPolicing remains a touchy subject
OL,4,Ain Northern Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FWalking around Belfast with a
OL,7,Fmicrophone and asking people to talk
OL,8,Fpublicly about policing is a revealing
OL,9,Fexperience.
OL,11,FIt highlights how just sensitive
OL,12,Fpolicing remains in Northern Ireland.
OL,14,FFew people wanted to discuss it, with
OL,15,F"touchy subject" a regular response
OL,16,Ffollowed by a hasty swerve away from
OL,17,Fthe microphone.
OL,19,FAs the Police Service of Northern
OL,20,FIreland (PSNI) marks its 25th
OL,21,Fanniversary, it is clear it does not
OL,22,Foperate in a conventional society.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
